&lt;p&gt;I received an M.Sc. in Computer Science and Technology (2021) and a B.S. in Mathematics and Physics (2018), both from Tsinghua University. During my M.Sc. studies, I was advised by &lt;a href="https://cg.cs.tsinghua.edu.cn/shimin.htm"&gt;Prof. Shi-Min Hu&lt;/a&gt; in the &lt;a href="https://cg.cs.tsinghua.edu.cn"&gt;CSCG&lt;/a&gt; Group. I also collaborate with &lt;a href="https://engweb.swan.ac.uk/~cfli/"&gt;Prof. Chenfeng Li&lt;/a&gt;. My research interests lie in physically-based animation in computer graphics.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>